  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting good governance in the UK Overseas Territories (UKOTs) through integrated activity across four workstreams (parliamentary, electoral, external audit, and internal audit) throughout the electoral cycle (pre-election, election, and post-election) so that parliamentarians, parliamentary and electoral officials as well as external and internal auditors from the UKOTs have improved their legislative, governance, oversight, and electoral environment.</narrative>
  </description>
